{"id":"3e81fa800505e986","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-convergent-frame.md","title":"Four-Parameter Frame Convergence","display":"df-convergent-frame — Four-Parameter Frame Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-convergent-frame","aliases":["89-df-convergent-frame"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-convergent-frame — Four-Parameter Frame Convergence","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-iteration]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-convergent-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-convergent-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-convergent-frame — Four-Parameter Frame Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为 Kripke 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j,m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\\)</span> 是下文定义的四索引框架谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^k\">\\(R^k\\)</span> 是关系幂。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\;\n((wR^ix\\land wR^jy)\\to\n\\exists z\\in W\\;(xR^mz\\land yR^nz)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\;\n((wR^ix\\land wR^jy)\\to\n\\exists z\\in W\\;(xR^mz\\land yR^nz)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 88–90；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>四个索引不可交换：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\">\\(i,j\\)</span> 是从共同前驱出发的两条路径长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\">\\(m,n\\)</span> 是两条向共同终点的长度。零长度表示同一世界。譬如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,2,1,0)\">\\((0,2,1,0)\\)</span> 还原为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^2\\subseteq R\">\\(R^2\\subseteq R\\)</span>，即传递性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,0,1,0)\">\\((0,0,1,0)\\)</span> 还原为每个世界有自环，即自反性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j,m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"R^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}convergent\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\;\n((wR^ix\\land wR^jy)\\to\n\\exists z\\in W\\;(xR^mz\\land yR^nz)).","display":true},{"tex":"i,j","display":false},{"tex":"m,n","display":false},{"tex":"(0,2,1,0)","display":false},{"tex":"R^2\\subseteq R","display":false},{"tex":"(0,0,1,0)","display":false}],"bytes":1109,"backlinks":[{"id":"42a3ef8675246492","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcabe060a57a2a7b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a668d880013388bd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"716a176673d9ea45","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-convergent-frame]]、[[89-df-convergence-logic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"收敛：[[89-df-modal-iteration]] → [[89-lem-canonical-relation-powers]] → [[89-df-convergent-frame]] → [[89-thm-canonical-convergence]] → [[89-thm-convergence-completeness]]。边界：[[89-prop-gl-canonical-transitive]]、[[89-ex-gl-canonical-reflexive-world]]。"}],"outgoing":["e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00"]}